that, especially when you have got Putin making&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:46.800
terribly concerning statements about using nuclear&nbsp;
weapons against Great Britain. I mean, the last&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:52.720
thing we want to do is to get into a world war.
Speaker 1: Two different things that are touchy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:57.520
to say the least. And if there's anything you&nbsp;
can tell us about them, it would be great.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:05.120
