recent video that Vladimir Putin is ill looking,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:11.920
swollen, gripping a table, just a very unhealthy&nbsp;
appearance and lots of speculation about that as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:18.160
