have to be governed by the basic facts of what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:32.320
we can confirm, and that is that we need&nbsp;
to continue to help the Ukrainian people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:40.320
have as tough a resistance as possible with the&nbsp;
hopes that when Putin is sufficiently pushed back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:45.040
that we can have a negotiated settlement.
Speaker 1: Last question on this. Do you.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:50.400
Aside from what would be acceptable responses&nbsp;
to it, where it's a different question? Do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:57.280
